{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":95,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"O come, let us sing unto the LORD: let us make a joyful noise to the rock of our salvation.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":", let us "},{"t":"sing","s":["H7442"],"a":[1]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":": let us make a joyful "},{"t":"noise","s":["H7321"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3468"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Let us come before his presence with thanksgiving, and make a joyful noise unto him with psalms.","tok":[{"t":"Let us "},{"t":"come","s":["H6923"],"a":[0]},{"t":" before his "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"thanksgiving","s":["H8426"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and make a joyful "},{"t":"noise","s":["H7321"],"a":[4]},{"t":" unto him with "},{"t":"psalms","s":["H2158"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"For the LORD is a great God, and a great King above all gods.","tok":[{"t":"For the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"King","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" above all "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"In his hand are the deep places of the earth: the strength of the hills is his also.","tok":[{"t":"In his "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are the deep "},{"t":"places","s":["H4278"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":": the "},{"t":"strength","s":["H8443"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"hills","s":["H2022"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is his also."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The sea is his, and he made it: and his hands formed the dry land.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is his, and he "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" it: and his "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"formed","s":["H3